"""
ROBOMLM_PLUS User Service
=========================

Core user-domain service for ROBOMLM_PLUS.

Responsibilities:
    - User identity/domain representation
    - User lifecycle state
    - User preferences/metadata boundary
    - User contract normalization
    - User validation
    - User service authority boundary

This module MUST NOT:
    - generate market intelligence
    - generate trading decisions
    - mutate D13
    - calculate risk
    - override CAS
    - execute orders
    - mutate positions
    - perform billing/entitlement decisions
    - contain UI logic

Billing/subscription authority belongs to:
    app.subscription

Authentication/security authority belongs to the appropriate
authentication/security layer.
"""

